}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Since B has only a first component, <p, B(x, y)> = pb[[1]] B1(x, y): only the \
first component of the adjoint vector enters the formula. It is\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c4d5f731-e2d6-47e5-a8cf-b7e090ab9cb0"],

